# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# If your project uses WebView with JS, uncomment the following
# and specify the fully qualified class name to the JavaScript interface
# class:
#-keepclassmembers class fqcn.of.javascript.interface.for.webview {
#   public *;
#}
# Release crash fix (2026-11-09, v3.2.1): with `optimization { packageScope }` R8 repackaged Kotlin's
# multifile-class parts (e.g. kotlin.text.StringsKt__StringBuilderKt -> top-level `m32`) away from
# their package-private superclasses, so the release app died at start with IllegalAccessError
# ("Class kotlin.text.l extended by class m32 is inaccessible"). Keep the optimized libraries'
# classes in their own packages; they are still shrunk, optimized and renamed.
-keeppackagenames kotlin.**,kotlinx.**,androidx.**
